      <cyrillic>хомсотгох</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XOMSADXA-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus. of xomsad-] v. t. To diminish, keep down, cut down, curtail; to occasion a loss; to expend, consume.</definition>
      <page>960</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode> ᠬᠣᠮᠰᠠᠳᠬᠠᠵᠤ ᠲᠥᠰᠦᠪᠯᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zu tosybleky</transcript>
          <definition> To cut down or trim a budget.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠠᠳᠠᠭᠠᠳᠤ ᠡᠴᠡ ᠠᠪᠴᠢᠷᠠᠭᠤᠯᠬᠤ ᠵᠦᠢᠯ ᠤᠳ ᠢ ᠬᠣᠮᠰᠠᠳᠬᠠᠬᠣ </unicode>
          <transcript>γadaγadu ece abciraγulxu zyil yd i --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To restrict or limit imports.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
